# A free name that is only WRITTEN is a local of the call too (the first use is the capture): w assigns x, answers 5, and the root's x stays 10 (bare
# assignment changes only the value of the activation, node_write). Observed: r is the answer of w, rx the root's x after the call.
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: r 0
        int: rx 0
)
@: shared data[0]
int: x 10
fn: w () int
    x := 5
    return: x
int: r w()
int: rx x

sub: main ()
    shared\Observed\r := r
    shared\Observed\rx := rx
main()
